# Third-party notices

## Runtime dependencies

**None.**

The shipped application (`Wff.App`, `Wff.Engine`) uses only the
.NET 8 base class library and Windows API surface via P/Invoke
(`user32.dll` for `RegisterHotKey`, `GetWindowRect`, `GetForegroundWindow`,
`GetWindowLong`, and the optional `WH_KEYBOARD_LL` hook). There are **no
NuGet package references** in any shipped project.

## .NET runtime

This project is published **framework-dependent**: it does not bundle or
redistribute the .NET runtime. Users install
[.NET 8 Desktop Runtime](https://dotnet.microsoft.com/en-us/download/dotnet/8.0)
themselves from Microsoft, under Microsoft's own terms. win-fast-finder is not
affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Microsoft.

